# Tests of the community Elm test suite (test/elm-test-suite.sh) that lamdera is expected to fail,
# one per line as <project>/<TestName>, with the reason after a #.

elm-conformance/DebugToStringTest  # Debug.toString record field order changed in 0.19.3 (the suite calls this a quirk)
elm-conformance/CharCaseFullRangeTest  # only with node whose Unicode is older than 17.0 (node 24.8 has 16.0)
